#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:1
msgid "Shanghai Technology Innovation Center"
msgstr "上海市科技创业中心"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:4
msgid "上海市科技创业中心"
msgstr "上海市科技创业中心"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:6
msgid "Research platform | Xuhui | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "科研平台｜徐汇区｜研究核对日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:8
msgid "AI and industry focus: Software AI, Hardware AI, Industry."
msgstr "人工智能与产业方向：软件人工智能、硬件人工智能、产业。"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:10
msgid ""
"The municipal science-and-technology entrepreneurship service institution "
"coordinating Shanghai's high-quality incubator cultivation system, "
"innovation vouchers, technology SME filings and the Startup in Shanghai "
"portal."
msgstr "市级科技创业服务机构，统筹上海市高质量孵化器培育体系、科技创新券、科技型中小企业服务及“上海科创在线／创·在上海”平台。"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:12
msgid "`Evidence S059 <https://shtic.com/>`_. 上海市科技创业中心."
msgstr "`证据 S059 <https://shtic.com/>`_. 上海市科技创业中心."

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:14
msgid ""
"`Evidence S060 "
"<https://stcsm.sh.gov.cn/zwgk/tzgs/gsgg/zhgsgg/20250721/5376ca63676c438dac68a2f1b6313366.html>`_. "
"关于公布纳入2025年上海市科技创新创业载体培育体系载体的通知_业务公示公告_上海市科学技术委员会."
msgstr "`证据 S060 <https://stcsm.sh.gov.cn/zwgk/tzgs/gsgg/zhgsgg/20250721/5376ca63676c438dac68a2f1b6313366.html>`_. 关于公布纳入2025年上海市科技创新创业载体培育体系载体的通知_业务公示公告_上海市科学技术委员会."

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:16
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "状态与支持"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:19
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构有来源，招募待确认"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:21
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "本条未核实统一现金资助、免费权益或股权比例，请索取现行书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:23
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系与位置"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:26
msgid "`Official website / intake route <https://shtic.com/>`_"
msgstr "`官网／对接入口 <https://shtic.com/>`_"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:28
msgid ""
"A direct program phone or email is not verified here. Use the official "
"route and request the responsible team; no contact has been invented."
msgstr "本版未核实项目直线电话或邮箱。请通过官方渠道索取负责团队，本图谱不编造联系人。"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:30
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图位置使用区级或校区锚点，并非核实后的办公室位置。"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:32
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:35
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:37
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读带日期通知，核验属地、主体、业务及支出期间。"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:39
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "准备规定材料，按要求完成单位或区级推荐。"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:41
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止前通过官方平台提交并保存回执。"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:43
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "遵循通知中的评审、立项、报告、验收及拨付义务。"

